{"id":"tipp","lemma":"Tipp","pos":"noun","rank":2262,"glosses":["tip, hint"],"ipa":"/tɪp/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/6a/De-Tipp.ogg/De-Tipp.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Tipps","plural":"Tipps"},"examples":[{"text":"Er gab mir einen Tipp.","en":"He gave me a hint.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to give","l":"geben"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null]},{"text":"Danke für den Tipp!","en":"Thanks for the hint.","words":[{"g":"thanks, thank you"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},null]},{"text":"Sie gab ihm ein paar Tipps zur Aussprache.","en":"She gave him a few pointers on pronunciation.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to give","l":"geben"},{"g":"(to) him","l":"er"},null,null,null,{"g":"to the"},{"g":"pronunciation"}],"phrases":[[3,5,"some"]]},{"text":"Dann will ich dir mal einen kleinen Tipp geben.","en":"Let me give you a word of advice.","words":[{"g":"then, after that"},{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},{"g":"just / once"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},{"g":"small, little, wee","l":"klein"},null,{"g":"to give"}]},{"text":"Ich gab Tom einen Tipp.","en":"I gave Tom a tip.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to give","l":"geben"},null,{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null]}]}